@startuml
title SSD-01: Submit Standard Loan Request
actor Member
boundary "Community Equipment Loan System" as System
Member -> System: submitLoanRequest(memberNumber, typeCode, quantity, collectionDate, durationDays)
alt valid request
  System --> Member: requestAccepted(reference, SUBMITTED)
else invalid or unavailable request
  System --> Member: requestRefused(reason)
else controlled system failure
  System --> Member: requestFailed(reason)
end
@enduml
